OL,3,GNEWSACouncil defends drain cleaning
OL,4,Aafter flash flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Dr Shabina Qayyum, Labour leader of
OL,7,FPeterborough City Council, said: "We
OL,8,Fhave a complex network of drainage
OL,9,Fsystems under Peterborough... we do
OL,10,Fsurvey them on a regular basis."
